    description: "Kotlin, Scala and Dart call-resolution import readers misread star imports and aliases.\n\nWI-palus added separate small file-level readers for type canonicalization in these three languages because the existing call-resolution readers bind a star import as if it were a name, and mis-key aliases (import a.b.C as D). Call resolution still uses the old readers. Check the effect on call edges, then share one correct reader per language. Found by PR 5 agent 4 (stable-id v17 branch, 2026-11-20) while building WI-palus (type names hashed through the file's imports): ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr5/palus/RESULTS.md section 6; repros in pr5/palus/residual_probe/."  # b85b
